	(text "JETSON AUTO-ON AND CAN-INITIATED SHUTDOWN\nEPS applies VBAT. Valid supplies and the RC delay clock U105 to assert POWER_EN.\nIHU requests Linux shutdown over CAN. Jetson SHUTDOWN_REQ clears U105 and drops POWER_EN.\nReleasing SHUTDOWN_REQ alone does not restart the module. Cycle EPS VBAT for a normal restart.\nIHU cuts VBAT after shutdown. Measure the required wait and minimum off-time on the bench."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 237.998 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
